cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Smoking, aging, and the gut microbiome — analysis code for Bao et al., NTR-2026-092"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the supplementary results of Bao et al. (NTR-2026-092),
  a secondary analysis of the Guangdong Gut Microbiome Project (GGMP)
  examining the joint relationship of smoking and aging with the gut
  microbiome and cardiometabolic risk profiles. Includes the rarefaction
  / sequencing-depth supplement, the male-only sensitivity analysis,
  family- and genus-level OLS robustness re-tests, the MaAsLin2 family /
  genus and male-only OTU cross-checks, the ten-mediator cardiometabolic
  panel, and the Optuna-tuned LightGBM smoking classifier.
